     "widgetType": "text-editor",
     "settings": {
      "editor": "<p>The cheapest things you can buy at Schnitz are a dipping sauce (about $2 approx.) and a small serve of tenders (about $7.90 approx.). For a full meal on a budget, look out for value deals that bundle a small wrap, mini chips and a drink, which have sold for around $10 in the past.</p>"
